2. Add note: "Part of CrisPRO R&D - Learn More →" with link to `/products/r-d`
3. Keep same visual design

### **Phase 4: Update Navigation**

**File:** `src/components/shared/Navbar.tsx`

**Changes:**
- Remove "Engines" from navigation (if exists)
