## 🔄 MIGRATION STRATEGY

### **Option A: Keep Individual Pages (RECOMMENDED)**
- Keep `/products/oracle`, `/products/forge`, etc. as-is
- Add RDEnginesSection that links to these pages
- EngineRoom links to `/products/r-d#engines` (scrolls to engines section)
- Users can still access engines directly via URL

### **Option B: Move to Sub-Routes**
- Move engine pages to `/products/r-d/engines/[slug]`
- Redirect old URLs to new locations
- More structured but requires more migration work

