- Keeps existing engine pages
- Clear visual connection
- Easy to maintain
- Users can still bookmark individual engine pages

**Implementation Order:**
1. Create `RDEnginesSection.tsx` component
2. Add to `/products/r-d/page.tsx`
3. Update `EngineRoom.tsx` links
